cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "DeconvolutionReview: a benchmark harness for gene expression deconvolution"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for a critical survey of gene expression
  deconvolution. Isolates the effect of the loss function, non-negativity and
  sum-to-one constraints, normalisation, feature selection, and regularisation
  on deconvolution accuracy across ten benchmark datasets.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/shmohammadi86/DeconvolutionReview"
license: MIT
